WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
One set of sounds needs special mention.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.500
These sounds are often labeled retroflex because the tip of the tongue is turned backwards when they are pronounced.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Except in some words borrowed from another language, as in the first word of those you are about to hear, these sounds do not occur at the beginning of a word.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Now listen to and try a few of them.

